# November 19, 2026: Yavapai County, Arizona (region az). A first batch for central Arizona: the Verde Valley's Sinagua
# pueblos (Tuzigoot, Montezuma Castle) and the Apache Wars fort at Camp Verde; the copper town of Jerome (the Douglas
# Mansion, the United Verde hospital, the Audrey headframe); territorial Prescott (the Governor's Mansion, the courthouse,
# the Hassayampa Inn, the old Sacred Heart church); and the Bradshaw Mountains (Walker charcoal kiln, Palace Station,
# Crown King, Mayer, Stanton).
# Facts come from the linked sources only: Wikipedia articles read as raw text (tools/wiki_raw.py), the managing bodies'
# pages (Arizona State Parks, NPS, the Jerome Historical Society) read with tools/page.py, the Palace Station Register form,
# HMdb, an Arizona Highways drive guide and one hiking write-up. Pins were looked at on Esri satellite and LiDAR shading
# (research/pincheck_az_rqhw_*.jpg); each pin note says what that showed.
